### Cross-department source reconciliation — 12 Oct 2026

A parallel-development conflict was found and resolved **offline/source-only** before any Development deployment.

**Finding:** the staged Department 3 v12.3.25 canonical-Creator candidate was built from the Department 2 security line and did **not** contain the newer v12.3.21 Books active-customer checkout gate or the currently observed v12.3.22 business-identity/Books-mapping guard. Deploying v12.3.25 as-is would have regressed those protections.

**Unified candidate prepared:** `mf_zoho_gateway v12.3.26 UNIFIED_LAUNCH_GUARDS`
- preserves Department 2 fail-closed SalesIQ/security work;
- preserves v12.3.25 canonical Creator `Sales_Order_ZBooks` reconciliation after a verified Books SO;
- restores v12.3.21 requirement that every payment method, including CASH/COD, has a mapped/reachable/active Books customer before the order writer;
- restores v12.3.22 PROFILE↔BUSINESS_ACCOUNT CR/VAT drift blocking, account-scoped Books mapping reuse, business↔membership Books mapping mismatch blocking, and explicit admin identity confirmation;
- corrects runtime/package version metadata to 12.3.26.

**Verification:** `node --check index.js` PASS; full suite **184/184 PASS**; source secret/artifact preflight PASS; ZIP integrity PASS. SHA-256: `4465b6fe05d9ba248a47af5c92e464e07526640e20b5948614490079e63836e6`.

**Live state during reconciliation:** Development health reported v12.3.22. Therefore v12.3.24/v12.3.25 must not be deployed independently over it. v12.3.26 is STAGED ONLY, not proof of live deployment. No Production action and no Books/Creator financial write occurred.

Next gate: secure source review/rollback snapshot → coordinated Development deployment of the single unified candidate → anonymous/authenticated smoke + cross-business 401/403/200 probes → Inventory item/warehouse read proof → owner-approved low-value COD pilot with exactly one Books SO and one canonical Creator mapping.

**Department 2 coordination:** treat v12.3.26 as the superseding security candidate for review; do not deploy standalone v12.3.24. Secret rotation and API Gateway/session/role probes remain separate release gates.
